%I A401350 #8 Oct 24 2026 09:41:30
%S A401350 5,211,7926,327273,2500190,16127161
%N A401350 Number of free polyominoes with 4n cells that can be quadrisected into four congruent polyominoes.
%C A401350 Each quarter is necessarily an n-omino. Here congruent means equal up to rotation, reflection and translation, so the various quarters may be mirror images of each other.
%H A401350 John Mason, <a href="https://github.com/jmasonmilan/PolyUtil">Java programs to generate the sequence</a>
%Y A401350 Cf. A000105, A400866, A400883.
%K A401350 nonn,more,new
%O A401350 1,1
%A A401350 _John Mason_, Oct 22 2026
